  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Improve Macrofiscal Stability and Help Boost Growth in Ecuador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para Mejorar la Estabilidad Macro Fiscal y Contribuir a Impulsar el Crecimiento en Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es contribuir al crecimiento econmico en Ecuador mediante mayor sostenibilidad fiscal y fomento de inversin en sectores estratgicos, a travs de los objetivos especficos de desarrollo de: (i) incrementar la eficiencia del sistema tributario; (ii) mejorar la eficiencia del gasto pblico; y (iii) fomentar mayor inversin privada en sectores estratgicos, como energa y turismo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s overall development objective is to contribute to economic growth in Ecuador through greater fiscal sustainability and the promotion of investment in strategic sectors, by pursuing the specific development objectives of: (i) increasing the efficiency of the tax system; (ii) improving the efficiency of public spending; and (iii) fostering greater private investment in strategic sectors such as energy and tourism.</narrative>
  </description>
